{% comment %}
  Social-proof pill for the buy box: overlapping customer avatars, a verified
  badge, and two lines of copy on a rounded chip.

  The chip is pulled left underneath the avatars so the two read as one object
  rather than as a row of images next to a box. That overlap is why the avatars
  carry a white ring — without it the stack loses its edges against the chip.

  Renders nothing until at least one of the two copy lines is set: a chip with
  avatars and no claim says nothing.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the trusted_by block. Reads settings.image_1 … image_3,
    .title, .subtext, .bg_color and .text_color.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-trusted-by__block', block: block %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign image_keys = 'image_1,image_2,image_3' | split: ','
  assign chip_bg = block.settings.bg_color | default: '#EFEFEF'
  assign chip_text = block.settings.text_color | default: '#282828'
-%}

{%- if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.subtext != blank -%}
  <div
    class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted"
    style="--trusted-bg: {{ chip_bg }}; --trusted-text: {{ chip_text }};"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted-avatars">
      {%- for image_key in image_keys -%}
        {%- assign avatar = block.settings[image_key] -%}
        {%- if avatar != blank -%}
          <span class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted-avatar">
            <img
              src="{{ avatar | image_url: width: 120 }}"
              alt=""
              width="120"
              height="120"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The verified mark sits at the end of the stack, on the same overlap, so
        it reads as the last "face" in the row rather than as a loose icon.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted-check" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor"></circle>
          <path
            d="m7.6 12.3 3 3 5.8-6.4"
            stroke="#ffffff"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          ></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted-content">
      {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
        <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted-title cwc-rte">{{ block.settings.title }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if block.settings.subtext != blank -%}
        <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__trusted-subtext cwc-rte">{{ block.settings.subtext }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
